-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The boundary-integral solvers build on external libraries that are referenced
ONLY as git submodules (their source is not redistributed in this repository)
and remain under their own licenses:

  * chunkie -- https://github.com/fastalgorithms/chunkie -- BSD 3-Clause.
  * FLAM    -- a submodule of chunkie (chunkie/chunkie/FLAM) -- GPL v3.
               The dense boundary-integral codes call FLAM through chunkie, so
               any redistributed COMBINED or runnable work that includes FLAM is
               subject to FLAM's GPLv3 terms.  The MATLAB files in THIS
               repository are BSD-3-licensed (above) and may be reused as such.
  * fmm2d   -- a submodule of chunkie (chunkie/chunkie/fmm2d) -- Apache 2.0.
               Not used by these dense examples.

The COMSOL scripts additionally require a commercial COMSOL Multiphysics
installation with the Wave Optics Module (the "ewfd" interface) and LiveLink
for MATLAB (not included).
